{"id":"661370","name":"炖牛肉粒","author":"双鱼座的美食","authorId":"11350065","desc":"","cover":"images/661370/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"3斤"}],"sub":[{"name":"水","amount":"250ml"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"洗干净后切丁，大一些，一炖就缩了。","img":"images/661370/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切大丁。","img":"images/661370/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"凉水下锅，葱姜料酒，去血水浮沫。","img":"images/661370/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"撇出不少浮沫。","img":"images/661370/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入高压锅中，煎入葱，姜，花椒，大料，桂皮，香叶，盐，老抽，一米饭碗水。","img":"images/661370/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"高压锅90帕，45分钟。","img":"images/661370/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"压好拌饭或者再加点土豆啥的炖炖都好吃。","img":"images/661370/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}